      "writtenOn": "2023-11-21T18:55:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we want to send EC_HOST_EVENT_HANG_DETECT. EC_HOST_EVENT_HANG_REBOOT seems to be the one sent after reboot (so that the AP can record the incident). At least that was the original intension.",
      "range": {
