      "writtenOn": "2023-11-21T18:55:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "These are mutually exclusive (as indicated by \u0027all the other fields are ignored\u0027). They\u0027re like a command, not flags. Can we separate commands and flags?\n\nIt originates from the past CLs but since you\u0027re obsoleting most flags and adding new \u0027commands\u0027, it\u0027s probably good time to fix this mis-usage of \u0027flags\u0027.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 4738,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 4757,
        "endChar": 32
      },
      "revId": "03d61b6644ea1ceb8a4dcf549f1cb456237e0f60",
